pboard! The generated content has been copied.\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No date format validation\", \"actual\": \"Entered \\\"NotADate123\\\" into the required Start Date field; no error message or format validation appeared, and the field accepted the invalid value. Date fields are plain free-text inputs with no format checking.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No start/end date order validation\", \"actual\": \"Set Start Date to \\\"Dec 2025\\\" and End Date to \\\"Jan 2020\\\" (start after end); no validation error was shown and the form accepted the values without restriction.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Submit Template\\\" with empty Title, Author Name, Description, and Content fields triggered a toast: \\\"Missing required fields / Please fill in all required fields.\\\" and the dialog remained open, blocking submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No special character restriction\", \"actual\": \"Typed \\\"￥#@%^*Test\\\" into the Full Name field; all special characters were accepted verbatim with no filtering and no \\\"Special characters are prohibited\\\" message.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-18\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No Markdown syntax validation on submission\", \"actual\": \"Submitted a template with clearly malformed Markdown (unclosed ``` code block, unclosed **bold, broken [link( syntax); the app accepted it with the same \\\"Template submitted!\\\" success toast and added it to the library without any syntax warning or rejection.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Before filling required fields, the dialog showed \\\"Required fields missing\\\" alert listing missing fields, and the Preview Result 